  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Energy Efficiency in Cambodia&apos;s Building Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Joint Program (JP) aims to support Cambodia&#x2019;s latest Updated Nationally Determined Contributions (NDC) to reduce 41% ofdomestic greenhouse gas emissions by 2030 compared to businessas usual, concentrated primarily in the Forest and Land Use, energy,agriculture, industry, and waste sectors. Accordingly, a general national goal to reduce total energy consumption was set at 19% by 2030, with a 25% reduction in the building sector in particular.</narrative>
  </description>
